/**
 * Login-face carousel slides (user-provided, 2026-11-18), Notta-login style:
 * the illustration card (source cropped to 1200x740, the baked-in caption band
 * removed — the caption now renders as live text below the card) plus a
 * zh title/description pair. Inlined as JPEG q78 data URIs — same pattern as
 * login-artwork.ts — so Vite and Next.js resolve them identically without
 * public-dir coupling (the /app basePath would also break plain URLs).
 */
